rl":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4092413150/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4095633687","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117513#issuecomment-4095633687","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117513","id":4095633687,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc70HmkX","user":{"login":"dblqt","id":40189253,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTg5MjUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40189253?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt","html_url":"https://github.com/dblqt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-20T05:16:39Z","updated_at":"2026-03-20T05:16:39Z","body":"Thank you @jack-klein-5 for looking into this.\n\nYour screenshots show exactly the same settings as mine. Except that the dotnet -> editor also includes the 'Custom Exec Path' and 'Custom Exec Path Args'\n\n<img width=\"1213\" height=\"732\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a90c8947-7f77-4b63-8e19-c93dd73858b7\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4095633687/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4095644370","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117513#issuecomment-4095644370","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117513","id":4095644370,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc70HpLS","user":{"login":"dblqt","id":40189253,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTg5MjUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40189253?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt","html_url":"https://github.com/dblqt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-20T05:18:39Z","updated_at":"2026-03-20T05:18:39Z","body":"Also the path to VSCode seems fine as it is able to operate on GDScript files and can open C# files using the File System's context menu item 'Open in External Program'. Very strange.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4095644370/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4096116846","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117513#issuecomment-4096116846","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117513","id":4096116846,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc70Jchu","user":{"login":"dblqt","id":40189253,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTg5MjUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40189253?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt","html_url":"https://github.com/dblqt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-20T07:04:39Z","updated_at":"2026-03-20T07:29:08Z","body":"@jack-klein-5 I found the problem.\n\n[GodotSharpEditor](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/c71c2bfc5e61e937cbbf2bd8eefa499ba6864ef5/modules/mono/editor/GodotTools/GodotTools/GodotSharpEditor.cs#L315)\n\nThe code seems to only work when the VSCode executable is in the `PATH` environment variable. \n\nI did not investigate why there are different code paths being executed depending on whether the C# code is opened via double-click or 'Open in External Program'.\n\nP.S.: As a hot fix you may just want to test the 'Custom Exec Path' for non-emptiness and availability, before testing the `PATH` environment variable.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4096116846/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4099075611","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117513#issuecomment-4099075611","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117513","id":4099075611,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc70Uu4b","user":{"login":"jack-klein-5","id":56490766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NDkwNzY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56490766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5","html_url":"https://github.com/jack-klein-5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-20T15:30:10Z","updated_at":"2026-03-20T15:30:10Z","body":"@dblqt Hey, nice find! Thank you for looking into it further.\n\nYou're right, it looks like the **Dotnet->Editor->External Editor->Visual Studio Code and VSCodium** depends on the PATH being set. \n\n**Custom Exec Path** and **Custom Exec Path Args** look to be in use only when **External Editor** is set to **Custom**, so that could be a fix for your issue. \n\nAlternatively, it does look like setting **Dotnet->Editor->External Editor** to **Disabled** and using **Text Editor->External** setting instead works without PATH variable\n\nI'm not sure if this is intended behavior, but it doesn't look like there are any obvious bugs here, so any changes would be above my pay grade. It seems like at the very least we should be editing some labels and/or documentation to make this all more clear. But that's just my opinion.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4099075611/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4099384578","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117513#issuecomment-4099384578","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117513","id":4099384578,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc70V6UC","user":{"login":"jack-klein-5","id":56490766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NDkwNzY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56490766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5","html_url":"https://github.com/jack-klein-5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-20T16:24:24Z","updated_at":"2026-03-20T16:24:24Z","body":"Although on second thought, the right click \"Open in external program\" prioritizes **Text Editor** over **Dotnet** like you said. So there is a precedent. I'll make a pull request later with your suggestion of checking **Text Editor** before trying to use the PATH and see what the Powers That Be have to say","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4099384578/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4102799815","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117513#issuecomment-4102799815","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117513","id":4102799815,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc70i8HH","user":{"login":"dblqt","id":40189253,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTg5MjUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40189253?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt","html_url":"https://github.com/dblqt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dblqt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-21T07:58:36Z","updated_at":"2026-03-21T08:02:06Z","body":"@jack-klein-5 I don't think you want to release your change. I left a comment on the pull request.\n\nAfter having spent some time with you on this matter I feel the text editor integration is a bit of a can-of-worms.\nIt may require some serious refactoring.\n\nI suggest to leave it as is for now and update the documentation at:\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.html\n\nI.e. mention that for most editors it relies on them being present in the `PATH` environment variable.\n\nI also noticed that it does not mention the `Custom` option for the external dotnet editor.\n\nOne less invasive change you may want to consider on the DotNet -> Editor screen:\nDisable/Hide the `Custom Exec Path` and `Custom Exec Path Args` settings when `External Editor` is not `Custom`.\nAssuming they only apply to the `Custom` option, which at first glance seems to be the case.\n\nMy issue is fixed. Thanks a lot, and keep up the great work.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4102799815/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4103568476","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117513#issuecomment-4103568476","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117513","id":4103568476,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc70l3xc","user":{"login":"jack-klein-5","id":56490766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NDkwNzY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56490766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5","html_url":"https://github.com/jack-klein-5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-21T15:29:48Z","updated_at":"2026-03-21T15:29:48Z","body":"Sounds good, thank you. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4103568476/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]